      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Communication between a branch of left anterior descending coronary artery and main pulmonary artery is rare and has been previously described. However, spontaneous closure has not been described previously. We report such a case in a 41-year-old man with exertional angina and coronary artery disease."},
